      "summaries": {
        "en": "Stop Slop is a skill file that removes AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more human. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate repetitive patterns, overly formal phrasing, and other giveaways. Use it as a post-processing step to refine AI outputs for emails, articles, or creative writing, ensuring natural readability.",
        "zh": "Stop Slop 是一个技能文件，用于去除散文中的AI痕迹，让AI生成的文本听起来更自然。它通过针对性编辑，消除重复模式、过于正式的措辞等AI特征。你可以将其作为后处理步骤，优化AI输出的邮件、文章或创意写作，确保阅读流畅自然。",
        "es": "Stop Slop is a skill file that removes AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more human. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate repetitive patterns, overly formal phrasing, and other giveaways. Use it as a post-processing step to refine AI outputs for emails, articles, or creative writing, ensuring natural readability.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "stop-slop gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Stop Slop is a skill file that removes AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more human. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate repetitive patterns, overly formal phrasing, and other giveaways. Use it as a post-processing step to refine AI outputs for emails, articles, or creative writing, ensuring natural readability.",
