      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepSeek-R1-0528 is an open-source reasoning model that excels at complex problem-solving through step-by-step chain-of-thought. It introduces a novel reinforcement learning approach that teaches the model to 'think' before answering, significantly improving accuracy on math, coding, and logic tasks. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's text-generation-inference or use it as a drop-in replacement for GPT-4 in reasoning-heavy applications like automated theorem proving or code debugging.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek-R1-0528是一款开源推理模型，专为复杂任务设计，通过强化学习在回答前生成链式思维中间步骤，显著提升数学、编程和逻辑问题的准确性。其核心亮点是自我纠错与多路径探索能力，而非记忆答案。用户可通过Hugging Face的text-generation-inference快速部署，或集成至自动定理证明、代码调试、科学文献分析等需严谨推理的应用。相比GPT-4，它提供更透明、可定制的推理引擎，尤其适合教育工具与可解释AI场景。",
        "es": "DeepSeek-R1-0528 is an open-source reasoning model that excels at complex problem-solving through step-by-step chain-of-thought. It introduces a novel reinforcement learning approach that teaches the model to 'think' before answering, significantly improving accuracy on math, coding, and logic tasks. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's text-generation-inference or use it as a drop-in replacement for GPT-4 in reasoning-heavy applications like automated theorem proving or code debugging.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepSeek-R1-0528 stands out for transformers, safetensors, and deepseek_v3 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepSeek-R1-0528 is an open-source reasoning model that excels at complex problem-solving through step-by-step chain-of-thought. It introduces a novel reinforcement learning approach that teaches the model to 'think' before answering, significantly improving accuracy on math, coding, and logic tasks. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's text-generation-inference or use it as a drop-in replacement for GPT-4 in reasoning-heavy applications like automated theorem proving or code debugging.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528 for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
