      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash is an efficient conversational AI model optimized for fast inference and low memory usage. It uses 8-bit quantization and FP8 training to reduce model size while maintaining high accuracy, making it ideal for deployment on resource-constrained devices. You can use it with Hugging Face Transformers for text generation or fine-tune it for domain-specific chatbots. Its MIT license allows unrestricted commercial use.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash是一款轻量级AI模型，专为高效对话生成设计，解决大模型在资源受限设备上的部署难题。通过8位量化与FP8训练技术，在保持高精度的同时显著降低显存占用和推理延迟，使复杂对话能力流畅运行于手机或边缘设备。其核心采用优化Transformer架构，支持长上下文理解，并兼容Hugging Face Transformers库，便于开发者快速集成。可用于搭建智能客服或虚拟助手，也可基于预训练权重进行医疗、教育等领域的微调。采用MIT开源协议，适合初创团队快速商用落地。",
        "es": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash is an efficient conversational AI model optimized for fast inference and low memory usage. It uses 8-bit quantization and FP8 training to reduce model size while maintaining high accuracy, making it ideal for deployment on resource-constrained devices. You can use it with Hugging Face Transformers for text generation or fine-tune it for domain-specific chatbots. Its MIT license allows unrestricted commercial use.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash stands out for transformers, safetensors, and deepseek_v4 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash is an efficient conversational AI model optimized for fast inference and low memory usage. It uses 8-bit quantization and FP8 training to reduce model size while maintaining high accuracy, making it ideal for deployment on resource-constrained devices. You can use it with Hugging Face Transformers for text generation or fine-tune it for domain-specific chatbots. Its MIT license allows unrestricted commercial use.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
